  "body": "## Summary\n- seal every new runtime Primer with exactly Commandments and Personality\n- preserve the approved Personality text exactly and keep its provenance in a separate encrypted Body record\n- remove behavioral and minimum-length censorship while retaining mechanical bounds and actual-secret rejection\n- verify the permanent birth Personality against its origin without silently rewriting legacy born SELF\n- document Personality as an origin-only lifelong lens whose learning accumulates in the VCW\n\n## Compatibility\n- existing legacy Primer envelopes remain readable\n- interrupted prebirth legacy envelopes are canonicalized before birth completes\n- already-born legacy SELF is never rewritten automatically\n\n## Verification\n- 50 framework tests pass\n- Ruff and whitespace checks pass\n- public-tree secret audit passes\n\nRaven, the private Compiler candidate, credentials, live VCW state, and real birth state are not included or modified.",
